OL,3,GNEWSAReform councillors' comments
OL,4,A'disgusting and embarrassing'
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents across Solihull have
OL,7,Fdescribed racist comments made by
OL,8,FReform UK councillors as "disgusting",
OL,9,F"embarrassing" and "scary" after the
OL,10,Ffallout from an ITV undercover
OL,11,Finvestigation.
OL,13,FThe broadcast showed councillor Alan
OL,14,FFeeney telling undercover reporters
OL,15,Fthat his ward has been "infested" with
OL,16,FAsian families, and called them
OL,17,F"absolute parasites".
OL,19,FBut conversations on the streets of
OL,20,FCastle Bromwich, Shard End and Shirley
OL,21,Frevealed something more nuanced than
OL,22,Fsimple outrage.
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,353,350,200,160,0,100
