OL,3,GNEWSAReform councillors' comments
OL,4,A'disgusting and embarrassing'
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhile some condemned the language used
OL,7,Fby councillors, others raised concerns
OL,8,Fover how their communities are changing
OL,9,Fand the impact the scandal has had on
OL,10,FSolihull's reputation.
